```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
- Exact match via `any()` over the note's `tags` — no substring matching.
- Preserves original order.
- Returns borrowed `&'a Note` references, matching the signature.

